From: Midgy BALON <midgy971@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Input: joystick: wire up the Trimui Smart Pro S gamepad

Add the Trimui Smart Pro S gamepad driver to the build. The handheld has
two MCUs, one per half, each streaming the controller state (buttons,
D-pad, analog sticks, triggers) over its own single-wire UART; the driver
binds both as serdev devices and merges them into a single virtual
Xbox 360-style input device, and drives the shared rumble motor via the
force-feedback memless core.

Driver source is kernel/drivers/gamepad-trimui-smart-pro-s.c in this repo;
drop it into drivers/input/joystick/. The DT serdev child nodes
(compatibles trimui,smart-pro-s-gamepad-left / -right under uart5 / uart7)
and their binding are already in the board DTS and kernel/bindings/.

Assisted-by: Claude (Opus 4.8)
Signed-off-by: Midgy BALON <midgy971@gmail.com>
---
 drivers/input/joystick/Kconfig  | 13 +++++++++++++
 drivers/input/joystick/Makefile |  1 +
 2 files changed, 14 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/input/joystick/Kconfig b/drivers/input/joystick/Kconfig
--- a/drivers/input/joystick/Kconfig
+++ b/drivers/input/joystick/Kconfig
@@ -422,4 +422,17 @@
 	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the module will be
 	  called adafruit-seesaw.
 
+config JOYSTICK_TRIMUI_SMART_PRO_S
+	tristate "Trimui Smart Pro S gamepad"
+	depends on SERIAL_DEV_BUS && OF
+	select INPUT_FF_MEMLESS
+	help
+	  Say Y here to enable support for the gamepad of the Trimui Smart
+	  Pro S handheld. Two MCUs on separate single-wire UARTs stream the
+	  controller state; this driver merges them into one virtual pad
+	  (buttons, analog sticks and rumble).
+
+	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the module will
+	  be called gamepad-trimui-smart-pro-s.
+
 endif
diff --git a/drivers/input/joystick/Makefile b/drivers/input/joystick/Makefile
--- a/drivers/input/joystick/Makefile
+++ b/drivers/input/joystick/Makefile
@@ -41,3 +41,4 @@
 obj-$(CONFIG_JOYSTICK_WALKERA0701)	+= walkera0701.o
 obj-$(CONFIG_JOYSTICK_XPAD)		+= xpad.o
 obj-$(CONFIG_JOYSTICK_ZHENHUA)		+= zhenhua.o
+obj-$(CONFIG_JOYSTICK_TRIMUI_SMART_PRO_S)	+= gamepad-trimui-smart-pro-s.o
